SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus (reappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Venus reappears at 11:34:33 BST\, seen from London\, GB.\nThe M
 oon rises during the occultation: only the reappearance is above the horiz
 on.\nThe Moon is 5° up in the SE · daylight\, Sun +39°.\nTimes for the 
 Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: 
 https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=51.5085&lon=-0.1257
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=51.5085&lon=-0.1257
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
